{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/659b2560888419a4131aa994430b0544.avif?t=1767132857\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Video Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden ages of video rentals by opening your very own video store. Rent, sell, organize and build your business from the ground up and revisit those beloved childhood memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.poster.avif?t=1767132857\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.webm?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.mp4?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Your Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the cash register, give movie recommendations or make your customers their favorite snacks. There are many things to do in a day's work when managing your store!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the walls and floors, decorate with posters and memorabilia and expand the layout of your shop to create the ultimate rental destination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.poster.avif?t=1767132857\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.webm?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.mp4?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Movies &amp; New Releases</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your shelves with thousands of unique VHS tapes, each with their own title, genre, cover art and rental statistics! Each week's new releases are inspired by real movies, iconic cult classics of the 80s.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Movies, Furniture &amp; More</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the local furniture catalogue for different shelves, signs or the coolest gumball machine. Order movies on your old PC or buy exclusive bootleg films from a shady Tape Dealer. There are many ways to grow your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong>\u00a0<strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Your Returns:\u00a0 Add returned movies in the system, rewind tapes and set aside reserved movies for your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Dream Team: Hire staff to give you a hand on daily tasks to run your store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Customer Interactions: Seasons, weather and holidays will affect gameplay and what your customers rent! Be ready, rainy Friday nights are crazy busy in the store!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons &amp; Festivals: Play through all four seasons as the environment transforms around you. Each season features special holidays and festivals, all brought to life with unique artwork!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share Movies With Your Friends: Every movie can be ordered on your PC with a unique code that you can share with your friends!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552140?t=1767132857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/13d4f7dd32c2f20b17b9bffc0bc388e1ec1a3c38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767132857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/942cdcf14d5185e5f2f8e3999e79ab062b4aad22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767132857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/942cdcf14d5185e5f2f8e3999e79ab062b4aad22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767132857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3858710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/659b2560888419a4131aa994430b0544.avif?t=1767132857\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Video Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden ages of video rentals by opening your very own video store. Rent, sell, organize and build your business from the ground up and revisit those beloved childhood memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.poster.avif?t=1767132857\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.webm?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.mp4?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Your Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the cash register, give movie recommendations or make your customers their favorite snacks. There are many things to do in a day's work when managing your store!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the walls and floors, decorate with posters and memorabilia and expand the layout of your shop to create the ultimate rental destination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.poster.avif?t=1767132857\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.webm?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.mp4?t=1767132857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Movies &amp; New Releases</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your shelves with thousands of unique VHS tapes, each with their own title, genre, cover art and rental statistics! Each week's new releases are inspired by real movies, iconic cult classics of the 80s.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Movies, Furniture &amp; More</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the local furniture catalogue for different shelves, signs or the coolest gumball machine. Order movies on your old PC or buy exclusive bootleg films from a shady Tape Dealer. There are many ways to grow your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong>\u00a0<strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Your Returns:\u00a0 Add returned movies in the system, rewind tapes and set aside reserved movies for your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Dream Team: Hire staff to give you a hand on daily tasks to run your store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Customer Interactions: Seasons, weather and holidays will affect gameplay and what your customers rent! Be ready, rainy Friday nights are crazy busy in the store!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons &amp; Festivals: Play through all four seasons as the environment transforms around you. Each season features special holidays and festivals, all brought to life with unique artwork!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share Movies With Your Friends: Every movie can be ordered on your PC with a unique code that you can share with your friends!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Blood Pact Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst